        <item>
            <title>0.2.0-beta.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 03:59:48 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/inklethq/app/releases</link>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[inklet Portal for macOS 0.2.0 Beta 3

Changes since 0.2.0 Beta 2
- Display pages read their history and switch what is showing through
  the new Presentation API: Show Next reports an empty queue honestly,
  and any earlier card can be put back on the display.
- Settings now do what they say: Launch at login, Show in Dock (with a
  menu bar item), system notifications for delivered, failed, and
  offline, and weather on Home.
- Settings tabs are ordered General, Notifications, Account, About.

Known limitations
- Requires macOS 26.

]]></description>
